        "body": "# [3.122.0](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.EventStore/compare/v3.121.0...v3.122.0) (2026-10-14)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* add comprehensive tests for Event Store Gateway and Mixed Projection Catalog ([561beed](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.EventStore/commit/561beed21df562314f5721acc62661748bd280f4))\n* **ci:** restore projection fixtures and guarded release evidence ([1dac529](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.EventStore/commit/1dac529c4690910c89d4090784a7d46cb9433a9d))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* add terminal advisory intent and repair mechanisms ([34c97ac](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.EventStore/commit/34c97acf9812c30ff610398baf3e00c9c9ed6c19))\n* **domain-service:** support explicit public routes with private canonical GET inventory ([bd976ef](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.EventStore/commit/bd976eff37e80fa404ee47d4031ecf6c2545b541))\n* **tests:** enhance idempotency and recovery tests with improved diagnostics and state management ([24d7192](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.EventStore/commit/24d719292b06d8a9d09771d837f8dd4d8d9b8997))\n"
